on multiple occasions actually. Considering all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:07.920
this, I don’t think you’d be surprised to hear&nbsp;
that Oracle has a total of 5 billion end users&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:15.060
which is more than any of the FAANG companies.&nbsp;
And yes, even Google only has 4.3 billion users.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:20.580
Likely the only companies that boast a larger&nbsp;
